IN-DISTRIBUTION COMPOSITION GROKKING PROBE (R34) — s2/composition_grok.py
Qwen/Qwen2.5-0.5B, RTX 4090. The last reachable growth-necessity probe after R32 closed OOD
composition. Reframe: 2 relations r1=friend (A->B), r2=pet (B->C); atomic all trained; 2-hop
"A's friend's pet is"->C. Small bridge set (bridge=60, 6 A per bridge) => held-out A's (B,C) are
exercised by OTHER A's trained 2-hop => IN-DISTRIBUTION query holdout (not R32's OOD). Vocab pool
= 13262 single-token entities (fixes R32's ~44 limit). derange control = per-example wrong C
(assert derange_same_target_count=0). atomic:2hop=1:1, holdout 70/30. Metric = no-memory no-CoT
next-token exact match on held-out 2-hop; onset = first eval with held2>=0.3 and >2x control.

REACHABILITY (unlike R32's OOD=0.000): in-distribution 2-hop composition IS reachable and FAST at
+0 depth — held2 0.85-0.87 by step 500, grokked (2/2 seeds), control ~0. So the phenomenon exists.

DEPTH SWEEP (main, +0 vs +4, 2 seeds, 10000 steps, eval every 500):
  grow+0: mean onset=500  mean final held2=0.983  (2/2 grokked)  wall 1252s
  grow+4: mean onset=500  mean final held2=0.979  (2/2 grokked)  wall 1420s
  => +4 does NOT lift ceiling (0.979 < 0.983) and does NOT cut onset; costs MORE wall-clock.

FINE-ONSET (4 seeds, 1500 steps, eval every 50 — resolve sub-500 onset):
  grow+0: onsets [50,100,100,100] mean 87.5   final held2 mean 0.929   wall ~195s
  grow+4: onsets [100,100,100,100] mean 100.0  final held2 mean 0.960   wall ~221s
  => onset: NO growth advantage (+0 marginally EARLIER at 4 seeds; the 1-seed "+4 onset=50" was
     noise). ceiling at 1500 steps: +4 +0.031 — BELOW the +0.10 bar AND it reverses by convergence
     (10k: +0 0.983 > +4 0.979). +4 ~15% slower per step throughout.

VERDICT — growth-necessity: ROBUSTLY FAILS.
  - No onset advantage (4-seed tied/+0 earlier).
  - No convergence-ceiling advantage (tied ~0.98, +0 marginally higher); transient short-window
    +0.031 is < the +0.10 pre-registered bar and vanishes by convergence.
  - +4 costs more compute (wall-clock) throughout, and atomic recall stays ~1.0 for both.
  None of the pre-registered growth-pass conditions (onset -30% at matched compute OR ceiling +0.10)
  are met. Growth is NOT necessary for in-distribution composition.

COMPLETE COMPOSITION PICTURE (R32 + R34): composition is either OOD-impossible-for-all (R32: held-out
entities = 0.0 even for the full-FT upper bound) or IN-DISTRIBUTION-easy-for-+0 (R34: ~0.98, grokked
by step 50-100, depth doesn't help). In BOTH regimes growth is unjustified. This is the 4th
independent negative for growth at 0.5B synthetic scale (after R23 retention, R31 capacity, R32 OOD
composition). Pod 9sjee4p8ct5kub terminated.

Caveats: 0.5B, synthetic 2-relation KG, bridge=60 moderate scale (Wang et al. grokking used thousands
of entities / ~1M steps — a much larger +0-only pilot could still be run, but +0 already saturating
at ~0.98 leaves no ceiling headroom for growth to demonstrate here).
